messages.signoff:
The course is finished and waiting for your approval.
  Look at it: {file}
  See what was checked and anything still open: courseforge findings list --course {id}
  If you are happy, release it with:
    courseforge gate approve --course {id} --stage release
    courseforge continue --course {id}
  If something needs changing, say what, and CourseForge will fix it and ask again:
    courseforge gate reject --course {id} --stage release --instructions "what to change"
